1
00:00:07,382 --> 00:00:08,550
Hello.

2
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:10,719
You're Seung-hyun Park, right?

3
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:11,761
You're a bit early.

4
00:00:11,761 --> 00:00:13,263
Yeah, I am.

5
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:14,764
I'm Seong-ho Yoon
one of the therapists here.

6
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:16,683
Your main therapist
is Ji-sung Kang

7
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:19,686
but his session
isn't over yet.

8
00:00:19,686 --> 00:00:22,063
While you wait
I can show you around

9
00:00:22,063 --> 00:00:23,690
and help you get started
with some light stretching

10
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:26,693
and a pre-session warm-up.
This way?

11
00:00:26,943 --> 00:00:29,446
Sure!

12
00:00:32,943 --> 00:00:35,941
Even the stretching is tough.

13
00:00:35,943 --> 00:00:39,446
Guess that shows
how bad the injury was.

14
00:00:39,453 --> 00:00:42,446
Will I really be able
to play again?

15
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:44,869
Hi there.

16
00:00:48,214 --> 00:00:50,258
Sorry for
the late introduction.

17
00:00:50,258 --> 00:00:53,261
I'm Ji-sung Kang.

18
00:00:53,408 --> 00:00:58,261
It's that guy from earlier.

19
00:00:58,767 --> 00:01:01,019
Shall we begin the session?

20
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:04,355
Huh? I'm not ready ye...

21
00:01:04,355 --> 00:01:05,982
[Rehab Room]
Wait, I said I'm not ready!

22
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:07,317
Hold on!

23
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:09,360
Coach!

24
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:11,738
Just a second!
